{"explanation":"Iteratively apply the Collatz rules, incrementing a counter for each transition until the value reaches 1. For n in 1..100, all intermediate values remain small enough for exact Number arithmetic, and the loop terminates with a finite step count. The input is not modified.","code":"function solve(n) {
