{"explanation":"For US coin denominations 25, 10, 5, and 1, a greedy approach gives the minimum number of coins. Use as many quarters as possible, then dimes, then nickels, and finally pennies. Each division is floored, and the remaining cents are carried forward.","code":"function solve(cents) {
