}"}

{"explanation":"Use the digital root formula: zero maps to zero, otherwise the result is 1 + ((n - 1) mod 9). This is equivalent to repeatedly summing decimal digits and stays within safe numeric bounds for the given domain.","code":"function solve(n) {
